menu "CEE-PEW OLED Configuration"

    config CEEPEW_OLED_FORCE_SH1106
        bool "Force SH1106 mode (column offset +2)"
        default n
        help
            Force the OLED driver to use SH1106 initialization and column
            addressing. Enable this if your hardware uses an SH1106 controller
            instead of an SSD1306 — both panels ACK identical I2C transactions,
            so auto-detection is unreliable. When enabled, the +2 column offset
            is applied at init time rather than relying on runtime fallback.

endmenu
